80979352338446,"pace":0.0957685369540366,"expectedEarly":342033,"expectedTotal":1307226,"date":"2026-10-28"},"news":[],"media":[{"who":"Kyle Kondik","what":"Sabato's Crystal Ball moved the Oklahoma governor race between Mike Mazzei and Cyndi Munson from Safe Republican to Likely Republican.","when":"2026-10-22","lean":"nonpartisan"}],"donorSignal":null,"research":{"summary":"Trump endorsed former state Sen. Mike Mazzei is favored for the open seat in a state no Democrat has won for governor since 2006, though a small Cross Timbers poll in mid October showed him only three points ahead of House Minority Leader Cyndi Munson. Mazzei is running on eliminating the income tax while Munson stresses public schools, affordability and a public vote on the abortion ban, and national groups have now put $3.5 million into the race.","issues":[{"issue":"Income tax","why":"Mazzei says he will cut taxes and eliminate the state income tax, pointing to tax cuts he passed as finance chairman.","src":"https://www.kosu.org/mazzei-munson-oeta-debate"},{"issue":"Public schools and vouchers","why":"Munson cites nearly 4,000 emergency certified teachers and opposes private school vouchers, while Mazzei backs parental choice.","src":"https://www.readfrontier.org/stories/mike-mazzei-and-cyndi-munson-debated-we-checked-the-facts/"},{"issue":"AI data centers and the Inola smelter","why":"The candidates clashed over water use by data centers and a $255 million incentive for an aluminum smelter in Inola.","src":"https://www.readfrontier.org/stories/mike-mazzei-and-cyndi-munson-debated-we-checked-the-facts/"},{"issue":"Health care access","why":"Munson says half of counties lack an OB GYN, while Mazzei says Medicaid has $1.6 billion in questionable spending each year.","src":"https://www.readfrontier.org/stories/mike-mazzei-and-cyndi-munson-debated-we-checked-the-facts/"},{"issue":"Abortion","why":"Munson supports letting voters reconsider the state's abortion restrictions.","src":"https://www.radiooklahomanews.com/post/2026-oklahoma-governor-s-race-draws-500k-democratic-investment"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Governors groups put in $3.5 million","date":"2026-10-21","what":"The Republican Governors Association committed $3 million for Mazzei and the Democratic Governors Association $500,000 for Munson.","helps":"mixed","kind":"national","src":"https://www.radiooklahomanews.com/post/2026-oklahoma-governor-s-race-draws-500k-democratic-investment"},{"title":"Munson hits $11 million self loan","date":"2026-10-21","what":"Munson has criticized Mazzei's roughly $11 million in personal loans to his campaign.","helps":"D","kind":"attack","src":"https://www.radiooklahomanews.com/post/2026-oklahoma-governor-s-race-draws-500k-democratic-investment"},{"title":"Poll shows close race","date":"2026-10-14","what":"A Cross Timbers poll of likely voters had Mazzei 39 and Munson 36, with a very wide margin of error and many Republicans undecided.","helps":"D","kind":"local","src":"https://www.newson6.com/oklahoma-politics/oklahoma-governor-poll-mazzei-munson"},{"title":"Fact check of the debate","date":"2026-10-07","what":"The Frontier rated Munson's teacher and housing claims true and Mazzei's Medicaid waste claim mixed.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.readfrontier.org/stories/mike-mazzei-and-cyndi-munson-debated-we-checked-the-facts/"},{"title":"Debate moved for Trump rally","date":"2026-10-01","what":"The OETA debate was pre taped in the morning so Mazzei could attend a Trump rally in Durant, where Munson pitched herself as a governor for all Oklahomans.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.kosu.org/mazzei-munson-oeta-debate"},{"title":"Trump lifts Mazzei in runoff","date":"2026-08-25","what":"Trump endorsed Mazzei and called Drummond a fake Republican before the runoff, and Mazzei thanked him for help across the finish line.","helps":"R","kind":"endorsement","src":"https://www.newsweek.com/trump-backed-mike-mazzeis-chances-of-beating-cyndi-munson-in-oklahoma-12368327"}],"events":[{"title":"Eliminate the income tax","prompt":"A plan to phase out the state income tax is the centerpiece of the Republican campaign, while schools face a shortage of certified teachers. Where does the campaign stand on taxes?","issue":"econ","src":"https://www.kosu.org/mazzei-munson-oeta-debate","opts":[{"label":"Fund schools first","say":"Oppose eliminating the income tax and spend on teacher pay and classrooms.","pos":-0.7,"trump":null,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Targeted relief","say":"Cut the grocery tax and property taxes for seniors while keeping school funding whole.","pos":0.1,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Zero income tax","say":"Phase out the income tax and pay for it by ending corporate welfare.","pos":0.9,"trump":0.4,"tone":"fiery"}]},{"title":"Data centers and smelter","prompt":"Large AI data centers and a $255 million incentive for an aluminum smelter in Inola have residents worried about water and pollution. How does the campaign respond?","issue":"econ","src":"https://www.readfrontier.org/stories/mike-mazzei-and-cyndi-munson-debated-we-checked-the-facts/","opts":[{"label":"End the giveaways","say":"Oppose tax breaks for the smelter and demand strict water rules for data centers.","pos":-0.6,"trump":null,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Local say","say":"Let communities vote on big projects and require water use disclosure.","pos":0.0,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Welcome investment","say":"Say modern cooling and smelter technology are safe and the jobs are worth it.","pos":0.7,"trump":0.3,"tone":"calm"}]},{"title":"Trump rally conflict","prompt":"The televised debate was moved to the morning so the Republican could attend a Trump rally in Durant. How does the campaign use Trump in a state he won by over 30 points?","issue":"other","src":"https://www.kosu.org/mazzei-munson-oeta-debate","opts":[{"label":"Oklahoma first","say":"Say Oklahoma needs a governor focused on home, not national partisan politics.